---
import '@fontsource/anton/latin-400.css';
import '../styles/base.css';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head><meta charset="UTF-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" /><meta name="description" content="Two early-2000s design concepts for Bryson Newman's resume website." /><title>Choose a direction | Bryson Newman</title></head>
  <body>
    <main id="main">
      <header><span>Bryson Newman / Website design studies</span><a href="/documents/Bryson-Newman-Resume.pdf">Original resume PDF</a></header>
      <div class="intro"><p>Two takes. Same Bryson.</p><h1>Pick your playback.</h1><p>A resume website with some early-2000s attitude.<br />Open either concept to explore the full design.</p></div>
      <div class="concepts">
        <article class="concept tape"><a class="preview" href="/mockups/mixtape" aria-label="Explore Mixtape desktop"><img src="/previews/mixtape-desktop.png" alt="Mixtape desktop preview with a pink album cover, silver CD, and printed resume insert" width="1440" height="1000" /></a><div class="concept-info"><span>Concept A</span><h2>Mixtape desktop</h2><p>Chrome, translucent plastic, and a pink-and-yellow album insert. A resume you can read like liner notes.</p><a class="open" href="/mockups/mixtape">Open mixtape desktop ↗</a><a class="mobile" href="/previews/mixtape-mobile.png">Mobile screenshot</a></div></article>
        <article class="concept web"><a class="preview" href="/mockups/portal" aria-label="Explore 2003 personal portal"><img src="/previews/portal-desktop.png" alt="2003 personal portal preview with pink navigation, speakers, and a dense teal three-column layout" width="1440" height="1000" /></a><div class="concept-info"><span>Concept B</span><h2>2003 personal portal</h2><p>A loud nameplate, beveled tabs, speaker cabinets, and a proper sidebar. Welcome to my corner of the web.</p><a class="open" href="/mockups/portal">Open personal portal ↗</a><a class="mobile" href="/previews/portal-mobile.png">Mobile screenshot</a></div></article>
      </div>
      <footer>Both concepts use the same resume content. These are design previews for review.</footer>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
<style>
  body{background:#dddcd3;color:#171818;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}main{max-width:1220px;margin:auto;padding:0 35px}header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;font-size:11px;padding:22px 0;border-bottom:2px solid #171818}header span{font-weight:bold}.intro{padding:45px 0 35px}.intro>p:first-child{font-size:12px;margin-bottom:15px}.intro h1{font:400 clamp(44px,6vw,76px)/1.1 Anton;margin-bottom:18px}.intro>p:last-child{font-size:14px;line-height:1.6}.concepts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:25px}.concept{border:2px solid #171818;box-shadow:5px 5px #171818}.preview{display:block;background:#269f9f;border-bottom:2px solid #171818;overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:1.44}.preview img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:top}.concept-info{padding:25px}.tape{background:#ef6aa7}.web{background:#a0d1cd}.concept-info>span{font-size:11px;border:1px solid;padding:4px 8px}.concept-info h2{font:400 32px Anton;margin:18px 0 12px}.concept-info p{font-size:13px;max-width:45ch;min-height:62px}.open{display:block;width:max-content;padding:12px 15px;background:#171818;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;margin:20px 0 15px}.open:hover{background:#fff;color:#000}.mobile{font-size:11px}footer{padding:30px 0;font-size:11px}@media(max-width:700px){main{padding:0 18px}header{font-size:9px}.intro{padding:30px 0 20px}.concepts{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:25px}.concept-info{padding:20px}.concept-info p{min-height:0}}
</style>
